# Live GenUI Ask Pi (Analytics surface). Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in.
# Without these the Analytics Ask Pi still works — it falls back to the captured static fixtures.

# GenUI (C1) API key (server-side only; never exposed to the browser).
ASKPI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to the paid Sonnet C1 model; set this to a free model slug to stay on the free tier.
# ASKPI_MODEL=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Live Campaigns Ask Pi (CopilotKit agent on the new-campaign builder).
# Entirely optional: without a key the agent chat falls back to an offline echo
# agent, and the default new-campaign experience (the deterministic build
# wizard) needs no key at all.
#
# The runtime talks to any OpenAI-compatible endpoint — TrueFoundry's LLM
# gateway by default (which transparently routes Claude via Bedrock, so from
# our side it's a plain OpenAI client with a custom baseURL). To use a direct
# Anthropic key instead, set PI_AGENT_BASE_URL to https://api.anthropic.com
# and pick a plain Anthropic model id — but note direct Anthropic uses the
# Messages API, not chat/completions, so it will NOT work without also
# switching back to AnthropicAdapter in runtime.server.ts.

# Bearer token for the LLM gateway (server-side only).
# Legacy name ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is still accepted as a fallback.
# PI_AGENT_API_KEY=

# OpenAI-compatible base URL. Defaults to TFY's Pi workspace.
# PI_AGENT_BASE_URL=https://llm.tfy.pi.mypaytm.com/openai/v1

# Model routing string. Defaults to Haiku 4.5 via TFY.
# Swap to sonnet with e.g. pi-agentic/global.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6
# PI_AGENT_MODEL=pi-agentic/global.anthropic.claude-haiku-4-5-20251001-v1-0
